+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html>
+<head>
+	<meta charset="utf-8">
+	<title>
+		CSS Values and Units Test:
+		Viewport units are interpolated correctly (reference rendering)
+	</title>
+
+	<link
+		rel="author"
